Version 0.3 (6 September 2026):

  * support multiple source directories and merged directory views
  * add include and exclude pattern files
  * add build and test automation
  * preserve filter rule ordering for literal and wildcard patterns
  * harden rule, source, and configuration-file parsing
  * reject truncated paths and handle creation through source parents
  * use persistent file handles for I/O and implement fsync
  * correct symlink target handling and directory metadata
  * improve integration-test cleanup and source distribution contents

Version 0.2 (13 April 2016):

  * new --includefile/--excludefile parameter to provide multiple patterns in
    a file
  * included wildmatch implementation to enable globbing of sub-trees using "**"
  * introduced hash tables for faster lookup
